---
/** Home section 1: the petrol hero. Copy from design/site/v3-open-relay.html. */
---

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="zone">
    <div class="hero-top">
      <span class="state">For Windows</span>
      <a href="#privacy">See where your data goes</a>
    </div>
    <h1 id="hero-title">Put bills in<br />paycheck order.</h1>
    <div class="hero-lower">
      <p>
        The month doesn't pay your bills. Your paychecks do. Organize what's due around the money
        coming in.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-action">
        <a class="action" href="#pay-period">See a paycheck plan</a>
        <span class="hero-note">No FutureCheck account. No bank linking.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="handoff">
      <span>This paycheck</span>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 230 45" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path
          d="M4 34h72c38 0 30-23 67-23h81"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="3"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          fill="none"></path>
        <circle cx="222" cy="11" r="6" fill="currentColor"></circle>
      </svg>
      <span>Next paycheck</span>
      <p class="handoff-note">A little less sorting.<br />A clearer next step.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    --fc-focus: var(--fc-focus-on-hero);
    padding-top: 45px;
    background: var(--fc-hero);
    color: var(--fc-on-hero);
  }

  .hero-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 49px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .hero-top a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
  }

  .state {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
  }

  .state::before {
    content: "";
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--fc-accent);
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 1100px;
    font-size: var(--fc-text-h1);
    line-height: 1.02;
  }

  .hero-lower {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 70px;
    margin-block: 30px 43px;
  }

  .hero-lower > p {
    max-width: 43ch;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .hero-action {
    justify-self: end;
  }

  .hero-note {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .handoff {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-block: 26px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--fc-hero-rule);
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .handoff svg {
    flex: 1;
    width: clamp(100px, 16vw, 230px);
    max-width: 230px;
    height: 45px;
    color: var(--fc-accent);
  }

  .handoff-note {
    max-width: 24ch;
    margin-left: 35px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 71.875rem) and (min-width: 50.0625rem) {
    .hero-lower {
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .hero-lower > p {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .hero-action {
      justify-self: start;
    }

    .hero-note {
      max-width: 25ch;
    }

    .handoff {
      gap: 14px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .handoff-note {
      margin-left: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: 24px;
    }

    .hero-top {
      margin-bottom: 33px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    h1 {
      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .hero-lower {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-block: 25px 29px;
    }

    .hero-lower > p {
      max-width: 38ch;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .hero-action {
      justify-self: start;
    }

    .hero-note {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .handoff {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: initial;
      gap: 8px 12px;
      padding-block: 20px 24px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .handoff svg {
      min-width: 45px;
      height: 30px;
    }

    .handoff-note {
      flex-basis: 100%;
      max-width: none;
      margin: 6px 0 0;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  }
</style>
